## Documentation namespace

`docs/_internal/` is the agent-facing reasoning record. Its structure follows the work:

| Path | Holds |
|------|-------|
| `docs/_internal/<work-stem>/session.md` | current handoff for one work unit |
| `docs/_internal/<work-stem>/reasoning/<topic>.md` | work-specific reasoning |
| `docs/_internal/_project/session.md` | current cross-cutting handoff |
| `docs/_internal/_project/reasoning/<topic>.md` | cross-cutting reasoning |

Create each directory with its first real file. Update `session.md` in place; git history
is its archive.

